<h1>Yamaha Sirius Monthly Rental Price in Hanoi: Cost Planning Guide</h1>
<p>A month changes what a rental means. A daily rate is a decision; a monthly rate is a commitment, and the machine you commit to earns or loses its price every single day. The Yamaha Sirius is the fleet’s simple, sturdy answer to a month of Hanoi riding, and this guide lays out exactly what that month costs, in verified figures only, so the decision can be made with numbers instead of guesses.</p>
<p>The verified monthly rate for the Yamaha Sirius is 900,000 to 1,200,000 VND, and the figure you are quoted depends on the machine and the terms agreed at the counter. This page belongs to the <a href="/hanoi-motorbike-rental-cost/">Hanoi motorbike rental cost</a> hub, sits beside the <a href="/hanoi-motorbike-rental/">Hanoi motorbike rental</a> resource for the wider rental picture, and pairs with the <a href="/faq/">FAQ</a> for the practical questions renters ask most. All prices here are the verified rates of Motorbike Rental - Nguyen Tu at 112 Nguyen Van Cu in Long Bien, open daily from 09:00 to 21:00.</p>
